# Applied to every `dotnet build/restore/run` started from this repository.
# The SDK can target either the Go- or Rust-backed Proton.Cryptography package;
# the currently published source (ProtonDriveApps/dotnet-crypto) is Rust-backed.
-p:CryptoBackend=rust
# Use this repository's nuget.config for the referenced SDK projects too (the SDK's own
# nuget.config maps Proton.* packages to a feed that is not publicly available).
-p:RestoreConfigFile=%MSBUILDTHISFILEDIRECTORY%nuget.config
